e description\n\nWhen in editor, using Gamesir bluetooth gamepad, if the gamepad is idle for a certain amount of time, the gamepad turns off. The moment this happens, Godot freezes. Turning the bluetooth gamepad back on has not effect, and the only way to continue working is to forcibly shut down godot and reload the engine. \n\nThis has not been tested on a build yet, but reluctant to waste the time to test that when the editor crashes already.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nStart up a bluetooth gamepad before launching godot. Let the gamepad sit idle until it powers down. Watch godot freeze forcing the user to do a hard reboot of the engine.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123405/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123405/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}